{
  "about": "The list of each sheet, dialog and popover of Studio (musicindex ADR 0077 R-SHEET-2 item 2, ADR 0214). tools/drive-ui.mjs opens each entry with the step {\"sheets\": \"tools/sheets.json\", \"data\": NAME} and examines it at 390 px and at 761 px. `source` is the file and the component. `open` holds drive-ui steps that start at the start address in a 1280 px window. `panel` selects the open panel to examine, and the default is \"dialog[open]\". `data` names the condition that the entry needs, and the default is \"walk\": the walk data of .studio-dev/walk with the setup of ADR 0076. Add each new sheet to this list in the commit that adds the sheet.",
